  "portal_solution": "Before applying this update, make sure you have applied all previously released\nerrata intended for your system.\n\nTo update all RPMs for your particular architecture, run the following command:\n\nrpm -Fvh [filenames]\n\nwhere [filenames] is a list of the RPMs you wish to upgrade. Only the RPMs\ninstalled on your system will be updated. If the RPMs that are included in the\nlist are not installed on your system, they will not be updated. Note that you\ncan also use wildcards (*.rpm) if your current directory *only* contains the\ndesired RPMs. Please note that this update is also available from Red Hat\nNetwork, which many people find easier to use for applying updates.\n\nPlease note that this update is also available from Red Hat Network. Many people\nfind this an easier way to apply updates. To use Red Hat Network, run the\nfollowing command:\n\nyum update\n",
